+# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
+"""
+Python Markdown
+
+A Python implementation of John Gruber's Markdown.
+
+Documentation: https://python-markdown.github.io/
+GitHub: https://github.com/Python-Markdown/markdown/
+PyPI: https://pypi.org/project/Markdown/
